   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Housing for Victims of Sexual Assault/Trafficking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Portside Suites is Fair Haven Rape Crisis Center&apos;s future vision come to life!  This project supports our building acquisition, renovation &amp; expansion to include secure, non-congregate (private living spaces) housing for adults fleeing from dating violence, sexual assault, stalking or human trafficking.   Fair Haven&apos;s non-congregate housing will provide residents with individual living spaces, offering a level of privacy and will include comprehensive, wrap-around services for Survivors.</narrative>
  </description>
